                        "review": "It's main problem is that is boring, the investigation are too lineal, unintresting. and too dependant on its easy hacking minigame. The heist chapter was the only one that really intrgued me, it was intresting, constantly evolving and the game mechanics pleayed brilliantly with it. Sadly the other chapters are a slog and the riots chapter that could have been as good as the heist was diminished by unnecesary long conversation and one really stupid puzzle. The protagonist being absolutly unlikable didn't help.\r\n\r\nI came expecting something like Cyber manhunt or Orwell and left disappointed",
